Cursor

We use Cursor as a team, as do thousands of other organizations from NVIDIA=
 to Figma.

A few ways we=E2=80=99ve seen teams collaborate with Cursor:

* We built Slack ( https://cursor.com/docs/integrations/slack )=C2=A0and Li=
near ( https://cursor.com/docs/integrations/linear )=C2=A0integrations so y=
ou kick off agents and assign tickets by simply tagging @Cursor.
* Bugbot ( https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=3Dbugbot ), our code review pro=
duct, automatically reviews your changes with AI to help catch bugs, patch =
security issues, and improve code quality.
* Write Team Rules ( https://cursor.com/docs/context/rules#team-rules ) to =
ensure consistent coding standards, practices, and workflows across your te=
am when they use Cursor.
- Cursor Team

